    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: clearer variable names, `assertArrayEquals` instead of a manual loop, removed unused imports and dead code, and a brief comment explaining the intent.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: replaced the manual byte-by-byte loop with `assertArrayEquals`, removed unused imports (`EncoderException`, `CharEncoding`) and the dead `RUSSIAN_STUFF_UNICODE` constant and no-op `validateState` method, renamed variables to `swissGermanText`/`rawBytes`/`decodedBytes` for clarity, and added a brief Javadoc explaining why non-encoded bytes should pass through decode unchanged."
    }
